<title>UK: BFCE adds $25 million to step-up perpetual FRN.</title>
<headline>BFCE adds $25 million to step-up perpetual FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE FRANCAISE DU COMMERCE EXTERIEUR</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **75 BP   PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  99.41     FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER     99.41</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED FOR $125 MILLION ON 15.NOV.96.</p>
<p>	    **TO YEARS FIVE , 150 BP TO YEAR 10, +225 BP</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		AND ALL OTHER TERMS REMAIN THE SAME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
